{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe6 Build and Expand Your Bank</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/50667789c879ba077ef8e1892f0a1347.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Start with a small service desk and grow your bank from the ground up.<br>Open new areas, upgrade your services, organize the layout, and shape your bank in your own style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc54 Serve Customers Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.poster.avif?t=1764429445\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.webm?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/1c4232ce412fe944634a851327a987f0.mp4?t=1764429445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Verify IDs, complete transactions, approve loans, and manage the line.<br>Customer patience decreases \u2014 manage the flow well or they\u2019ll leave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Loans, Fees &amp; Research Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst